ative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Taboola.com Ltd. is a small-cap communication services business with a $533M market cap on $1.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +11% over the past three years, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at -3% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 30%.","The business throws off $163M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 9 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 4.93\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -10.3% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 7.9\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 48.0% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 20% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.1\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.7) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.4% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Heavy insider selling (net $106.1M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-106111830.0},{"text":"Communication Services ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Advertising-cycle exposure and content/regulatory risk \u2014 a single platform policy shift or ad-spend contraction cascades through the P&L quickly.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cord-cutting acceleration and audience fragmentation \u2014 legacy distribution bundles unravel faster than subscription revenue can replace them.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"AI-generated content commoditisation \u2014 as creation costs collapse toward zero, content libraries lose pricing power and differentiation narrows.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 51% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 55% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Taboola.com (NASDAQ:TBLA) Stock Gets Price Target Trim from Needham & Company LLC","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/taboola-com-nasdaqtbla-stock-gets-price-target-trim-from-needham-company-llc.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793884044.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"What Taboola.com (TBLA) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/taboola-com-tbla-said-q3-211418119.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793826858.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.226,"tier":0,"